pack-kitchen = Recipes, what to cook tonight, the home kitchen
pack-mail = Search and read mail, draft replies
pack-files = Read files the user sent, and save what you made as a file on the Desktop, Documents or Downloads
pack-web = Open web pages and check whether they work
step-load_tools = Getting { $detail } tools ready
step-load_tools-plain = Getting tools ready
tool-name-packs = Getting tools ready

